Acts 2:1 , The apostles, filled with the Holy Ghost, and speaking divers languages, are admired by some, and derided by others;
Acts 2:14 , whom Peter disproves;
Acts 2:37 , he baptizes a great number that were converted;
Acts 2:41 , who afterwards devoutly and charitably converse together; the apostles working many miracles, and God daily increasing his church.
